[00:00.000] 作词 : Dani Giguere
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Dani Giguere
[00:25.980]Eyes stained in gaudy scarlet
[00:33.377]Like poppies in may
[00:38.255]I hear your voice in silence
[00:44.323]In dreams I caress your face
[00:50.625]If I could carry your heavy heart
[00:53.600]I hope you know I would
[00:56.598]Protect your fragile smile, tired and sweet
[01:02.550]Your heart entwined in mine
[01:05.725]Budding like young leaves
[01:08.705]Fragile and precious, sweet fraying angel
[01:42.447]Polaroids of passing comets
[01:48.610]The afterglow of everyone you've been
[01:54.117]Cold kitchens, warm carpets
[02:00.535]Sharp chills on porcelain skin
[02:06.945]The twilight of our lives
[02:12.871]All that I could ever want
[02:18.980]Once here, in my arms
[02:25.024]Circling the drain
